about:
PXE Boot Server (Go) v{version}

DHCP  udp:67 (udp:4011 as well in ProxyDHCP mode)
TFTP  udp:69
HTTP  tcp:{port} ({httpState})
Boot directory  {root}
Configuration  {configPath}

Copy ipxe.efi / undionly.kpxe / wimboot / boot.wim into the boot directory
and set the client's NIC to network boot (PXE).
ProxyDHCP mode leaves your router's DHCP alone, so it pairs well with an existing router.
